{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106759","id":2540581498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6XbjJ6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106759","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106759.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106759.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106759","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106759/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106759/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106759/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ba68e2a1e8825598ecbe9935b85561226cc42c31","number":106759,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Update `time.cpp` year/unix time conversions to be constant time","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added functions to convert between year and day from unix timestamps in constant time, to avoid having to iterate one year at a time.\r\n\r\nCloses #106695.\r\n\r\nTested with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"distant_time\")\r\n\trun_test(\"near_times\")\r\n\trun_test(\"validate_times\")\r\n\t\r\nfunc run_test(p_name : String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(p_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [p_name, end - start])\r\n\r\nfunc distant_time():\r\n\tprint(Time.get_datetime_dict_from_unix_time(-50000000000000000))\r\n\tprint(Time.get_datetime_dict_from_unix_time(50000000000000000))\r\n\r\nfunc near_times():\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\tTime.get_datetime_dict_from_unix_time(10000 * i)\r\n\t\tTime.get_datetime_dict_from_unix_time(-10000 * i)\r\n\r\nfunc validate_times():\r\n\tvar file := FileAccess.open(\"res://time.txt\", FileAccess.READ)\r\n\twhile !file.eof_reached():\r\n\t\tvar line := file.get_line()\r\n\t\tif line.is_empty():\r\n\t\t\tcontinue\r\n\t\tvar datestr = line.substr(0, line.find(\",\"))\r\n\t\tvar seconds = line.substr(line.find(\",\") + 1).to_int()\r\n\t\tvar converted_seconds = Time.get_unix_time_from_datetime_string(datestr)\r\n\t\tvar converted_string = Time.get_datetime_string_from_unix_time(seconds, true)\r\n\t\tif (converted_seconds != seconds):\r\n\t\t\tprint(\"Error converting to seconds: %s -- result: %d\" % [line, converted_seconds])\r\n\t\tif (converted_string != datestr):\r\n\t\t\tprint(\"Error converting to string: %s -- result: %s\" % [line, converted_string])\r\n```\r\n\r\nold:\r\n```\r\n{ \"year\": -1584434956, \"month\": 8, \"day\": 29, \"weekday\": 4, \"hour\": 7, \"minute\": 6, \"second\": 40 }\r\n{ \"year\": 1584438895, \"month\": 5, \"day\": 4, \"weekday\": 3, \"hour\": 16, \"minute\": 53, \"second\": 20 }\r\ndistant_time: 2910ms\r\nnear_times: 278ms\r\nvalidate_times: 372771ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew:\r\n```\r\n{ \"year\": -1584434956, \"month\": 8, \"day\": 29, \"weekday\": 4, \"hour\": 7, \"minute\": 6, \"second\": 40 }\r\n{ \"year\": 1584438895, \"month\": 5, \"day\": 4, \"weekday\": 3, \"hour\": 16, \"minute\": 53, \"second\": 20 }\r\ndistant_time: 0ms\r\nnear_times: 277ms\r\nvalidate_times: 114472ms\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `res://time.txt` file used in `validate_times` was generated with c++ code below, writing one line for every 6 hours from Jan 1, -10000 to Jan 1, 10000, with both the formatted date string and seconds integer separated by a comma:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n#include <cstdint>\r\n#include <cstdio>\r\n#include <ctime>\r\n\r\nint main()\r\n{\r\n\tusing namespace std;\r\n\tconst int64_t INTERVAL = 86400 / 4;\r\n\tconst int64_t START = -377736739200;\r\n\tconst int64_t END = 253402300800;\r\n\t\r\n\tfor (time_t seconds = START; seconds <= END; seconds += INTERVAL) {\r\n\t\ttm *dt = gmtime(&seconds);\r\n\t\tprintf(\"%04d-%02d-%02d %02d:%02d:%02d,%ld\",\r\n\t\t\tdt->tm_year + 1900, dt->tm_mon + 1, dt->tm_mday,\r\n\t\t\tdt->tm_hour, dt->tm_min, dt->tm_sec,\r\n\t\t\tseconds);\r\n\t\tprintf(\"\\n\");\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn 0;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/m